    "text": "Have you ever thought about how starting fresh can actually challenge the status quo in your life? It’s not just about a new year or a new month; it’s about questioning what’s holding you back and giving yourself the permission to change. What if we embraced fresh starts not as resets, but as revolutionary acts of self-definition?",
